      "en": "In process of time, at the end of two years, his bowels fell out by reason of his sickness, and he died of severe diseases. His people made no burning for him, like the burning of his fathers.",
      "ko": "여러 날 후 이년만에 그 창자가 그 병으로 인하여 빠져나오매 저가 그 심한 병으로 죽으니 백성이 그 열조에게 분향하던것 같이 저에게 분향하지 아니하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "a9f808a0b774765db42dec816d78ebdd2ae920b14cdeeb89df5b2ea0e2b4345d",
      "translation_text_hash": "00377b0c83a493011db9830ad26d8151e63416d3500cdf60a24e95c38ade1668",
